      "data": {
        "text": "5. **L5 Command Bus (`statcraft_syntax`):**\n   - Implemented and registered commands: `var.rename`, `var.set_type`, `var.set_decimals`, `var.set_width`, `var.set_align`, `var.add`, `var.delete`, `data.add_row`, `data.delete_row`."
