    {
      "data": {
        "text": "1. **Hierarchical Document Data Model:**\n   - Implemented a structured typed document model on L6 `statcraft_app`: `OutputProcedure`, `OutputNotes` (dataset & sample metadata), `OutputItem`, and `OutputItemKind` (`DescriptivesTable`, `FrequencyTable`, `DatasetSummary`, `Warning`, `CustomText`), managed via `SelectedTarget`.\n   - Results now accumulate in an infinite, continuous vertical document scroll — new analyses append below without clearing or replacing previous results."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794063483751099200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
