    {
      "data": {
        "text": "2. **Outline Tree Pane & Vector-First UI:**\n   - The left outline pane includes a quick action toolbar: \"Clear All\" (`output-btn-clear-all`), \"Expand All\" (`output-btn-expand-all`), and \"Collapse All\" (`output-btn-collapse-all`).\n   - Collapsible hierarchical tree: document root (`paint_output_root_icon`), procedure folders (`paint_output_folder_icon` + `paint_vector_arrow`), syntax log (`paint_output_log_icon`), analysis notes (`paint_output_notes_icon`), pivot tables (`paint_output_table_icon`), and warnings (`paint_output_warning_icon`).\n   - All icons are 100% vector-rendered using `ui.painter()`, preventing \"tofu\" glyph rendering artifacts."
