      "data": {
        "text": "4. **TSV Export (Excel / Google Sheets Compatibility):**\n   - Implemented tab-separated values (TSV) serialization for descriptives, frequencies, notes, and dataset summaries.\n   - Table context menus allow one-click copying directly to the system clipboard for immediate pasting into spreadsheets with column integrity preserved."
