        "text": "5. **Syntax Logging & Analysis Metadata:**\n   - The \"Paste\" button in `Descriptives` and `Frequencies` dialogs appends genuine SPSS syntax to the syntax log.\n   - Analyses automatically record an authentic SPSS-style `Notes` block detailing dataset name, case count, variable count, and UTC timestamp."
