    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Integrated the complete canonical ensemble of all 12 menus from desktop IBM SPSS Statistics into the main StatCraft application window (`crates/statcraft_app`):\n1. **File**\n2. **Edit**\n3. **View**\n4. **Data**\n5. **Transform**\n6. **Analyze**\n7. **Direct Marketing**\n8. **Graphs**\n9. **Utilities**\n10. **Extensions**\n11. **Window**\n12. **Help**"
