      "data": {
        "text": "Implemented one of the foundational predictive modeling frameworks in IBM SPSS Statistics — **Multiple Linear Regression** (`Analyze -> Regression -> Linear...`, engine command `stat.regression.linear` / syntax `REGRESSION /DEPENDENT=... /METHOD=ENTER ...`):"
      },
