      "data": {
        "text": "Implemented the fundamental psychometric, survey, and applied statistical measurement procedure — **Reliability Analysis** (`Analyze -> Scale -> Reliability Analysis...`, engine command `stat.scale.reliability` / syntax `RELIABILITY /VARIABLES=... /SCALE('ALL VARIABLES') ALL /MODEL=ALPHA`):"
