    {
      "data": {
        "text": "Authored the exhaustive Contributor Guide for StatCraft — **`CONTRIBUTING.md`**, formalizing the ArtCraft / storytold ecosystem standards:"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794063483751648200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "1. **Ecosystem Foundations:** 100% Safe Rust (`#![forbid(unsafe_code)]`), prohibition of manual JS/TS, dual MIT / Apache-2.0 licensing, and Clean-Room principles without SPSS proprietary code.\n2. **Resource Guard:** Iron rule of single-threaded compilation (`-j 1`) to preserve developer and CI resources.\n3. **Never Crash:** Complete ban on panics (`unwrap`, `expect`, `panic!`, `todo!`), typed `Result<T, E>` error propagation, and defensive boundary checking.\n4. **Layering (L0..L6) & CommandBus:** Strict downward dependency hierarchy (`statcraft_io` $\\to$ `core` $\\to$ `algo` $\\to$ `reporting` $\\to$ `syntax` $\\to$ `app`), typed engine commands with Undo/Redo history and `.sps` syntax equivalence.\n5. **DialogKit & Vector-First UI:** Canonical modal layout specifications, prohibition of emoji and unsupported Unicode glyphs, rendering via vector primitives.\n6. **Zero-Hardcode i18n:** Zero natural language literals in GUI code, mandatory semantic keys `t!(\"...\")` with synchronized Fluent `locales/*.ftl` bundles.\n7. **File Size Guard:** Strict line ceilings (500 / 1000 / 1500) and the \"Decompose, don't prune\" architectural principle.\n8. **Testing & Golden Oracle:** Mathematical precision verified against SciPy ($\\le 10^{-6}$) and UI invariant test suites.\n9. **Automated Audit & Definition of Done:** Single-command quality gate `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- ci`, DoD checklist, and a 5-step procedure creation cookbook.\n10. **Integration:** Linked from both `README.md` and `README.ru.md`."
