    {
      "data": {
        "text": "3. **Version Synchronization & Multi-Platform Distribution:**\n   * Version `0.2.1` synchronized byte-for-byte in `Cargo.toml`, `packaging/windows/installer.iss`, `packaging/macos/Info.plist`, and `packaging/linux/control`;\n   * Added `*.pdf` rule to `.gitignore` preventing repository bloat from reference PDFs;\n   * Automated GitHub Actions multi-platform release pipeline for Windows (ZIP + Inno Setup Installer), Linux (TAR.GZ + .deb), and macOS ARM64/x64 (TAR.GZ + DMG)."
