      "data": {
        "text": "3. **Block 9: Date & Time Wizard (DATEDIFF, DATEADD, XDATE):**\n   * **Confirmed:** exact calendar interval computation in `DATEDIFF` across completed calendar years and months with day-boundary adjustments, calendar-aware `DATEADD` with month-end day clamping (`checked_add_months`), component extraction `XDATE.*` matching Sunday = 1 canonical index in `XDATE.WKDAY`, and multi-format parsing for ISO 8601, European, American formats and unix timestamps (`hyp_8` .. `hyp_11: supported`). Continuous floating-point fractions noted for minutes and hours."
