      "data": {
        "text": "Successfully completed the final Phase 3 of the comprehensive evidence-backed audit of StatCraft, evaluating the desktop user interface (Desktop GUI), Output Viewer pivot table generators, interactive editors, DialogKit design system, Fluent localization catalogs, and cross-platform distribution according to the ergonomic and visual standards of the **IBM SPSS Statistics** canon and the ArtCraft ecosystem regulations ([`AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md)). The entire evidentiary ledger is confirmed and recorded in **Craft Anything MCP** (`hyp_33` through `hyp_45: supported`):"
