      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "2. **Section F: Interactive Data Screens (M-25 — M-27):**\n   * **M-25 (Data View):** virtualized grid via `ScrollArea::vertical().show_rows(...)`, inline cell editing on double-click with Tab/Enter navigation, Value Labels toggle `1/A`, canonical diagonal strikethrough slash over inactive row numbers when `FILTER BY` is active (`hyp_37: supported`);\n   * **M-26 (Variable View):** display and editing of all 11 canonical SPSS metadata columns (Name, Type, Width, Decimals, Label, Values, Missing, Columns, Align, Measure, Role), strict SPSS naming rules validation (up to 64 chars, no invalid symbols/spaces, reserved words blocked), ellipsis buttons `...` for modal editor invocation (`hyp_38: supported`);\n   * **M-27 (Syntax Editor):** monospace editor with session timestamps, execution toolbar (Run Selection / Run All), CommandBus integration, and syntax paste pipeline from all dialogs via `[ Paste ]` (`hyp_39: supported`)."
