      "data": {
        "text": "3. **Section G: DialogKit Design System & 37 Modal Dialogs (M-28, M-29):**\n   * **M-28 (DialogKit Primitives):** standardized dimensions `DialogSize` (Standard 560x430, Subdialog 360x300, Properties 460x380, Compute 620x480, Alert 440x170), window centering, Type 1 bottom action bar (`[ OK ] [ Paste ] [ Reset ] [ Cancel ] [ Help ]`) with uniform button width dynamically calculated via `i18n Shield` ($\\ge 80 \\times 26$ px, 3px rounding), automated OK disable guard on incomplete input, `VariablePicker` lists with vector scale icons, and adaptive `TransferButton` (`hyp_40: supported`);\n   * **M-29 (37 Procedural Dialogs):** full suite audit. Static linter `xtask design-guard` confirmed 0 violations (0 raw buttons, 0 unmanaged dialog dimensions). All 37 dialogs support `[ Reset ]` idempotence and `.sps` syntax generation. 37/37 `dialog_invariants` passing (`hyp_41: supported`)."
