rl+O` — Open Data (`open_data_dialog` supporting `.stc`, `.sav`, `.zsav`, `.csv`, `.xlsx`);<br>     * `Ctrl+Shift+O` — Open StatCraft Project (`open_project_dialog`);<br>     * `Ctrl+S` — Save Project (`save_project`);<br>     * `Ctrl+Shift+S` — Save Project As (`save_project_as`).<br>3. **Repository Cleanliness &amp; Dialog Invariant Testing (DoD):**<br>   - Added headless regression test `test_headless_render_confirm_save_dialog` in `crates/statcraft_app/tests/dialog_invariants.rs` ensuring panic-free rendering and state compliance;<br>   - Ignored runtime `.statcraft/` session folders in `.gitignore`;<br>   - 100% pass across all 130+ workspace unit and integration tests with `-j 1` and complete pass on `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- ci` (`cargo fmt --check`, `clippy -D warnings`, `file-guard`, `design-guard`, `layers`, `parity`).</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 41: Full Project Workspace Persistence &amp; Restoration (.stc)</h3><p>*Time: October 29, 2026, 23:40 (~35 minutes)*</p><p>Implemented monolithic persistence of the complete StatCraft analytical workspace in the native `.stc` container format (analogous to `.psd` in Adobe Photoshop):<br>1. **L0 Project Container Extension (`statcraft_io::stc_codec`):**<br>   - Extended `StcContainer` with optional fields `output_viewer_json` and `syntax_text` preserving full backward compatibility (`Format Version 1`, `#[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = &quot;Option::is_none&quot;)]`);<br>   - Added constructor `StcContainer::with_project_data` for unified packaging of all session artifacts;<br>   - Guaranteed backward compatibility: legacy `.stc` files without viewer or syntax data load seamlessly without error.<br>2. **Output Viewer Serialization L6 (`statcraft_app::views::output_view`):**<br>   - Implemented `static_str_serde` module for safe deserialization of static localization keys (`&amp;&#39;static str` via `Box::leak`);<br>   - Full serialization support across all 19 `OutputItemKind` variants (descriptive statistics, f