d `save_syntax_as` backed by native `rfd::FileDialog` with `*.sps` and `*.txt` filters and directory retention;<br>   * Implemented one-click `save_syntax`: saves directly to the associated disk path when known, or delegates to `save_syntax_as` for unsaved scripts;<br>   * Extended `load_file_from_path` to handle `.sps` script files, populate `RecentFiles`, and activate the `SyntaxEditor` tab in `egui_dock`;<br>   * Output Viewer echoing: script loading and saving events are logged into the session outline tree (`* Syntax opened: ...`, `* Syntax saved: ...`).</p><p>3. **Top Application Menu Integration (`statcraft_app::app_menus::file_edit_view`):**<br>   * Added `File -&gt; Open Syntax...` (`menu-file-open-syntax`);<br>   * Added `File -&gt; Save Syntax As...` (`menu-file-save-syntax-as`).</p><p>4. **Zero-Hardcode Localization &amp; Status Bar:**<br>   * Added `StatusMessage::SyntaxOpened { name }` and `StatusMessage::SyntaxSaved { name }` with success indicator color `Tokens::MEASURE_NOMINAL`;<br>   * Added full bilingual translations in Fluent catalogs `locales/en.ftl` and `locales/ru.ftl`.</p><p>5. **Quality Control &amp; Definition of Done:**<br>   * Added regression test `test_syntax_save_and_load_lifecycle` in `crates/statcraft_app/tests/session_lifecycle_tests.rs`;<br>   * Verified code formatting via `cargo fmt --check`;<br>   * Passed `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -j 1 -- -D warnings` (0 warnings);<br>   * Passed `xtask file-guard` (279 files within strict limits), `xtask layers`, `xtask design-guard`, and `cargo test --workspace -j 1` (100% tests passing).</p><p>---</p><h3>Phase 60 / Release v0.2.2: Comprehensive Feature Guides &amp; Release Manifests Synchronization (Release v0.2.2)</h3><p>*Time: November 6, 2026, 21:00 (~30 minutes)*</p><p>Prepared and released **StatCraft v0.2.2** with version bumps across all project packaging manifests, authored an exhaustive bilingual feature guide (`docs/FEATURES.md` and `docs/FEATURES_RU.md`), and integrated direct links into root documentation files `README.md` and `README.ru.md`:</p><p>1. **Authored Comprehensive Feature Guides (`docs/FEATURES.md` and `docs/FEATURES_RU.md`):**<br>   * Prepared structured end-to-end documentation covering all implemented application modules:<br>     - Dual-view data management (streaming CSV/TSV reader, Calamine Excel, virtualized Data View with inline editing, Variable View supporting all 9 canonical SPSS types, value labels, and missing values);<br>     - Dataset manipulations (Sort Cases, Select Cases with expression calculator, Split File, Weight Cases);<br>     - Full Transform suite (Compute Variable, Recode, Automatic Recode, Shift Values, Count Values, Create Dummy Variables, Replace Missing Values, Time Series, Visual/Optimal Binning, Rank Cases, Date and Time Wizard, ADP, Programmability Transformations);<br>     - Statistical calculation procedures in Analyze (Descriptives, Frequencies, Crosstabs with $\chi^2$ and Fisher&#39;s exact test, Means breakdown, One-Sample t-test, Independent Samples t-test with Levene&#39;s and Welch&#39;s tests, Paired Samples t-test, One-Way ANOVA, Bivariate Correlations with tie corrections, Nonparametric tests: Mann-Whitney, Kruskal-Wallis, Wilcoxon Signed-Rank, and Sign test, Multiple Linear Regression OLS/WLS with Tolerance/VIF collinearity diagnostics, Scale Reliability Analysis with Cronbach&#39;s $\alpha$, Factor Analysis PCA with KMO and Bartlett&#39;s test);<br>     - Output Viewer with authentic multi-tier Pivot Tables, one-click TSV clipboard export for Excel, and interactive Outline tree navigation;<br>     - Batch `.sps` command syntax execution and non-destructive Undo/Redo;<br>     - Agent-ready architecture with typed `specs()` parameter schemas, batch syntax execution, and transparent isolation of in-development networking/charting modules on the Roadmap (`InDev`).</p><p>2. **Repository Documentation Integration:**<br>   * Embedded prominent feature guide link callouts in `